rn","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ga7jZd-JccpMqdSTgY2lUA","review_id":"-DLSbITG4jhNslxtz5O1Vg","date":"2019-01-17T02:10:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9445881843566895,"text_excerpt":"Holy moly this place is delicious!!! I only ate side dishes (on account of being vegetarian) and it still blew my mind. My fish and meat eating friends had excellent meals. The food is Asian- southern fusion... I had a salad with chili, citrus, and papaya, hush puppies and broccoli. My BF had wagu beef, and shrimp... which were amazing (drenched in chili / garlic sauce). The service was friendly! We'll definitely be back."},{"business_id":"ga7jZd-JccpMqdSTgY2lUA","review_id":"Y21fR7PxoiUtpgBdz_wErw","date":"2021-12-02T22:26:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9330401420593262,"text_excerpt":"I became so completely obsessed eating the food that we ordered here, I only got one food picture, which cracks me up. But I digress - let's talk about this spot and how amazing it was. Marjie's is about 3 minutes from us in Mid City, and somehow we'd never made it over. We had no reservations on a Monday, and it was already busy at 5:45! It was chilly, so we were lucky they found us an inside table, and off we went. We ordered some beers and wine (they had a great Beer Lao lager if you dig this), and then we proceeded to try and order everything (I am exaggerating, but not too much). So here we go: 1. Latkes - it's Hanukkah season, so we got some and they were solid! 2. Fried Hard Crabs ..."},{"business_id":"ga7jZd-JccpMqdSTgY2lUA","review_id":"RRbW8Nim9UN0khaC655aNQ","date":"2018-11-25T02:16:12","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9317492246627808,"text_excerpt":"I overheard a chef a I worked with whose favorite place was Marjie's. Marjie's was a great find! It has got to be one of my favorite places in NOLA now because of the Southeast Asian flavors that I can rarely find in NOLA. The overall experience reminded me of the good old, comfort food that I grew up on. The place was not too packed at the first visit, and only has about 80 reviews while I'm writing this review. I hope that changes because this place has exceptional service and food. The food: -Happy hour fried oyster 5$ snacks - a bit salty but really good flavor. Be sure to dip in the vinegar. -Papaya salad - really nice flavors, tart and some sweetness. -Pork shoulder steak was amazin..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ga7jZd-JccpMqdSTgY2lUA","photo_id":"539ZKTzTyO3C8kBiaGoZXw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/539ZKTzTyO3C8kBiaGoZXw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8282456398010254},{"business_id":"ga7jZd-JccpMqdSTgY2lUA","photo_id":"qATlH6q8MxB4IaTAKSP2nA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qATlH6q8MxB4IaTAKSP2nA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8261950016021729},{"business_id":"ga7jZd-JccpMqdSTgY2lUA","photo_id":"KQ43LiwVpSfrpAhyzyIKjg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/KQ43LiwVpSfrpAhyzyIKjg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8144680261611938},{"business_id":"ga7jZd-Jccp